# Staged by fisher-8hc.4 on 2026-11-26.
# UCI setoption (April 2006): https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/#gui-setoption.
# The April 2006 UCI uci/id/option/uciok passages give the response order.
# The fisher-l7f owner decisions (2026-11-22) supply the id name,
# the {version} placeholder and the id author.
# D12 (fisher-r6y, 2026-11-24) gives the sole spin option, its default and bounds.

> uci
< id name fisher {version}
< id author Fernando Bandeira
< option name MultiPV type spin default 1 min 1 max 255
< uciok
> isready
< readyok
> quit
! exit
